--- A record's field given only `[]`, its items walked by a loop and
--- pushed onto a list of lists of text, holds lists of text: compiled as
--- a list of text, the push had not built (Lory's frame, whose asks a
--- chart never made)
struct Box [asks, n]

fn calls_of[b]
    calls = [['a', 'b']]
    for a in b.asks
        calls = push[calls, a]
    calls

b = Box[[], 1]
log[len[calls_of[b]]]
log[calls_of[b]]
